        "message_id_md5": "8f4b29759c5d17d2700dcc3281e70424",
        "in_reply_to": "<DC585921-BCC5-45C9-83BE-4CE0FB3D750C@charite.de>",
        "content_type": "text/html",
        "body": "Dear Karen,<br><br>Thanks for the update, just sent you invoice #1561. Kindly review it and let me know if you have any other questions.<br><br>Also, could you please kindly provide me with the following information for the next steps:<br><br><ul>\n<li>The start and end date of your project. Your license will be valid for this period only. Your study/data will be removed after this time unless you want us to keep it for you (This incurs extra cost).<br><br>\n</li>\n<li>If possible, a short description/abstract for your project. I want to share it on our social media to help other researchers in the community.</li>\n</ul><div data-signature=\"true\" data-signature-id=\"4\">Thanks,<br>Maryam<br><br>--<br>Avicenna Research (formerly Ethica Data)<br><div><div>4109 - 295 Adelaide St W, Toronto, ON M5V 0L4, Canada</div></div>\n<div>Email: sales@avicennaresearch.com - Web: <a href=\"https://avicennaresearch.com\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">https://avicennaresearch.com</a><br>--</div>\n</div><div>\n<br><br>\n</div><div><blockquote type=\"cite\">On Thursday, October 24, 2024 at 6:08:44 PM, karen-anna Ollrogge wrote:<br><br><div>\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">Dear Maryam,</span></p>\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p>\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">thank you for providing the details regarding the licensing cost. Everything looks good to me, and I am happy to proceed with the next steps.</span></p>\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p>\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">Please go ahead and let me know if you require anything further from our side.</span></p>\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p>\n<p>Best regards,</p>\n<p>Karen</p>\n<div>\n<div>\n<span class=\"js-signatureMarker\"></span><p>_______________________________</p>\n<p>Karen Ollrogge, M.Sc. Psychologie</p>\n<p><b>Charité – Universitätsmedizin Berlin</b></p>\n<p>Klinik für Psychiatrie und Psychotherapie</p>\n<p>AG Affektive Störungen</p>\n<p>Charitéplatz 1</p>\n<p>10117 Berlin</p>\n<p>E-Mail.: <a href=\"mailto:karen-anna.ollrogge@charite.de\"><span style=\"color:#0563c1;\">karen-anna.ollrogge@charite.de</span></a>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p> </p>\n<div>\n<p><b>Von: </b><span>Maryam Hashemian &lt;sales@avicennaresearch.com&gt;<br>\n<b>Organisation: </b>Avicennaresearch<br>\n<b>Datum: </b>Donnerstag, 24. Oktober 2024 um 15:14<br>\n<b>An: </b>\"Ollrogge, Karen Anna\" &lt;karen-anna.ollrogge@charite.de&gt;<br>\n<b>Betreff: </b>[ext] RE: License for Study 3738</span></p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p> </p>\n</div>\n<p>Dear Karen.<br> Hope you are doing well.<br>\n<br> This is Maryam from the Avicenna Sales team and I am glad you have decided to use Avicenna in your new project.<br>\n<br> The total licensing cost to collect survey data from 304 participants for a period of 1 week will be CAD 912.00 (~ 610.94€)<br>\n<br> If you confirm the quote that I have provided, I will proceed with the next steps.<br>\n<br> Please let me know if you need any further clarification.<br>\n<br> Best,<br> Maryam</p>\n<div>\n<p>--<br> Avicenna Research (formerly Ethica Data)</p>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p>4109 - 295 Adelaide St W, Toronto, ON M5V 0L4, Canada</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p>Email: sales@avicennaresearch.com - Web: <a href=\"https://avicennaresearch.com\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"> https://avicennaresearch.com</a><br> --</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p> </p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>On Wednesday, October 23, 2024 at 2:15:57 PM, karen-anna Ollrogge wrote:</p>\n<div>\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">Dear Maryam,</span></p>\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">I hope you’re doing well! We would like to conduct another study with Avicenna, which is finally in its final stage. The study will involve 304 participants, with data collection lasting for one week. There will be four assessments per day along with an evening survey.</span></p>\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">I’ve already created most of the survey (3738, interFeel). Could you please provide me with an invoice, similar to the one we had for our previous project (attached)?</span></p>\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">Thank you in advance!</span></p>\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">Best regards,<br> Karen</span></p>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p>_______________________________</p>\n<p>Karen Ollrogge, M.Sc. Psychologie</p>\n<p><b>Charité – Universitätsmedizin Berlin</b></p>\n<p>Klinik für Psychiatrie und Psychotherapie</p>\n<p>AG Affektive Störungen</p>\n<p>Charitéplatz 1</p>\n<p>10117 Berlin</p>\n<p>E-Mail.: <a href=\"mailto:karen-anna.ollrogge@charite.de\"><span style=\"color:#0563c1;\">karen-anna.ollrogge@charite.de</span></a>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p> </p>\n</div>\n<p> </p>\n</blockquote>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p> </p>\n</div>\n<p><br><br></p>\n</div>\n<br>\n</blockquote></div><div><br></div><br><br>",
